# Downloaded market data. Deny the whole tree, then name the exceptions.
#
# This was `data/*.csv`, which covers exactly what download_data.py writes
# today and nothing else: a subdirectory, a .parquet cache, a .json dump or a
# .xlsx would all have been staged by `git add -A` without a word. Nothing had
# slipped through - but the fix is one line and the failure is a 59 MB commit
# nobody meant to make.
data/**
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/**/README.md
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
